tools/cardkit is ported from cashucard's tools/cardkit
(https://github.com/cashucard/cashucard, package 0.2.0). The files below are
copied as they are in that project's main branch:

    gp/bytes.ts          copied verbatim
    gp/des.ts            copied verbatim
    gp/test/node-des.ts  copied verbatim from testing/node-des.ts

These differ only in the statements named, all of them about this card's AIDs:

    gp/scp02.ts          one line: a comment says this card's DELETE whitelist
                         holds three AIDs rather than Cashu's six
    gp/test/des.test.ts  one line: the import path of node-des

    gp/test/scp02.test.ts
                         adapted: this card's AIDs and byte-for-byte literals,
                         and the whitelist test names three AIDs

Everything else in tools/cardkit is written for this project, and the upstream
code it does not need (identity, inspect, registry, reset, configuration,
holderCommands, the NFC tag and hello applets) was not ported.

Its licence follows verbatim.

